groovebox-scene 1
# Syn 1 on pad 1 through the panel: MENU + step 3, then OK, down twice and OK in the sound picker.
input 3200 press menu
input 4800 press step-3
input 6400 release step-3
input 8000 release menu
input 9600 press ok
input 11200 release ok
input 12800 press down
input 14400 release down
input 14800 press down
input 15200 release down
input 16000 press ok
input 17600 release ok
# A tap of PADS/KEYS makes the pads keys that play Syn 1.
input 19200 press pads-keys
input 20800 release pads-keys
# 40 MIDI notes held in KEYS mode: the last 8 take the voices of the oldest.
input 24000 note-on 36 100
input 24960 note-on 37 100
input 25920 note-on 38 100
input 26880 note-on 39 100
input 27840 note-on 40 100
input 28800 note-on 41 100
input 29760 note-on 42 100
